# Files excluded from Antithesis coverage instrumentation (they are still
# compiled, just copied verbatim). The instrumentor's AST rewrite can displace
# //go:embed directives into function bodies, breaking the build, so every
# file containing one is listed here. Regenerate the list with:
#
#   git grep -l 'go:embed' -- '*.go' ':!*_test.go' ':!examples/'
#
# Paths are relative to the repository root. The instrumentor fails if an
# entry does not exist, so remove entries when the files they name go away.
